# Jenkins Plugin Management

Plugin Management is used to:

* Install plugins.
* Uninstall plugins.
* Upgrade plugins.
* Downgrade plugins.
* Enable plugins.
* Disable plugins.

Example:

```text
Jenkins_Master
    |
    +--> JDK
    +--> Jenkins
    +--> Plugins
```

