# Application Build Environments

Example Java applications may require different JDK versions:

```text
java-webapp-project
    → JDK 17

java-webapp-project2
    → JDK 21
```

Typical environment flow:

```text
DEV
 ↓
BUILD
 ↓
QA
 ↓
UAT
 ↓
PROD
```

Artifacts:

```text
Build → *.war
QA    → *.war
UAT   → *.war
PROD  → *.war
```

